abstract: "Code and recorded research outputs for a method that preserves the probabilities of a frozen complete predictor within a pointwise relative half-Brier tolerance while omitting executable signal processing. Licensing differs between original software, generated results, upstream alignment fields, and vendored plotting resources; see DATA_LICENSES.md."
